.TH ORO-FS-HANDLE 3 "" "Oro Runtime" "Oro Runtime API Manual"
.SH NAME
oro:fs/handle \- JavaScript API module
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
import * as module from 'oro:fs/handle'
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
oro:fs/handle is a JavaScript API module exposed by the Oro Runtime.
.SH REFERENCE
